    "body": " Problem:\r\nev.win is the current window instead of the window the event is about\r\nfor deferred events, for WinResized/WinScrolled after the window was\r\nclosed, and for BufHidden.\r\n \r\nSolution:\r\nPass the window to apply_autocmds() and remove apply_autocmds_win().\r\nDeferred events record the window when triggered.\r\n",
